For calculation purposes, we have used the Vumatel Uncapped Fibre 50/50 Mbps package billed at R799 as a benchmark. The difference between this and your current Vumatel Fibre 100/100Mbps package is R150 per month. We will therefore credit your account with:

R150 x 7 months = R1,050

